    WHEN `s 415A(2) sections 444 to 446 (filing obligations of different descriptions of company)` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): the text as rendered carries two versions of subsection (2), one with and one without these sections, and does not say which is in force (fork F10)
