            AND (`the statement has been signed on behalf of the board by a director` OR `the statement has been signed on behalf of the board by the secretary of the company`)
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F15): "Any separate corporate governance statement must be approved by the board of directors and signed on behalf of the board by a director or the secretary of the company."
